   473|/**
   474| * Resolve a single decision state from the answer + evidence + optional
   475| * structured job record.
   476| *
   477| * Priority (lowest confidence wins so a contradiction never overclaims):
   478| *  1. If a structured job record is provided, trust it exclusively. Validate
   479| *     its fields and return the structured status. No text scanning.
   480| *  2. Text-based contradiction detection is REMOVED. The only valid contradiction
   481| *     is a structured record that is internally inconsistent (e.g. COMPLETED + blockedReason).
   482| *  3. If a success assertion is present but evidence is missing → BLOCKED (the
   483| *     missing evidence is the blocker). Status words inside quoted text, logs,
   484| *     previous messages, or error descriptions are ignored.
   485| *  4. If only success assertions + full evidence → VERIFIED.
   486| *  5. If only failure assertions → BLOCKED / FAILED / WAITING_OWNER depending on
   487| *     the exact label.
   488| *  6. If only banned promises + no evidence → BLOCKED (generic promise without
   489| *     evidence).
   490| *  7. Otherwise → READY (normal conversational reply, no claim made).
